@page "/"

<PageTitle>OneVision.UI Component Library</PageTitle>

<h1 class="ov-gallery-page-title">OneVision UI Component Library</h1>
<MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="ov-gallery-page-intro">
    Browse approved OneVision components and the shared pattern catalogue. Patterns are defined as trees so containers, tabs, sections and conditional panes can each be reviewed independently.
</MudText>

<MudGrid>
    <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
        <MudPaper Class="ov-library-card" Elevation="0">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">Components</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">Reusable primitives for actions, status, forms, lists and navigation.</MudText>
            <MudLink Href="components/buttons">Browse components</MudLink>
        </MudPaper>
    </MudItem>

    <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
        <MudPaper Class="ov-library-card" Elevation="0">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">Patterns</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4">@PatternCatalog.Patterns.Count shared pattern trees, including placeholders ready for comparison against the current apps.</MudText>
            <MudLink Href="patterns/connection-manager">Browse pattern catalogue</MudLink>
        </MudPaper>
    </MudItem>

    <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
        <MudPaper Class="ov-library-card" Elevation="0">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">Current baseline</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">.NET 9 · MudBlazor 9.11.0 · OneVision.UI 0.1.0</MudText>
        </MudPaper>
    </MudItem>
</MudGrid>

<section class="ov-demo-section mt-6">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">Pattern catalogue model</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
        Select a pattern container to review its full behaviour, a child tab/section to review that scope, or a leaf pane to isolate conditional UI. Every scope has a stable copyable <code>OVP-...</code> reference for use in design conversations.
    </MudText>
</section>

<section class="ov-demo-section mt-6">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" GutterBottom="true">Design-system rule</MudText>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
        OneVision applications should use OV components where an approved component exists. Direct MudBlazor usage remains an implementation detail rather than an application-level UI contract.
    </MudText>
</section>
